      `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service was being made pursuant to the subsection` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
