        `the plaintiff served process and any other papers in duplicate`
    AND `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service was being made pursuant to the subsection`
    AND `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)`

-- src:1201 | which sum shall be taxed as a part of the costs in the proceeding if the plaintiff shall prevail therein …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 256(d) (src:1201)
