§ `s 257 Merger or consolidation of domestic stock and nonstock corporations`

-- (a) "Any 1 or more nonstock corporations of this State, whether or not organized for profit, may merge or consolidate with 1 or more stock
-- corporations of this State, whether or not organized for profit."
-- src:1208 | Any 1 or more nonstock corporations of this State, whether or not organized for profit …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(a) (src:1208)
GIVEN constituents IS A LIST OF `dg7 Constituent corporation`
      `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` constituents `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section` MEANS
        any (GIVEN c YIELD `s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` c) constituents
    AND any (GIVEN c YIELD `the kind is a stock corporation` (c's `kind of corporation`) AND c's `where the corporation is formed` EQUALS `this State`) constituents
    AND all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `where the corporation is formed` EQUALS `this State`) constituents
    AND `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section`

-- "The surviving constituent corporation or the resulting corporation may be organized for profit or not organized for profit and may be a
-- stock corporation or a nonstock corporation."
-- src:1208 | The surviving constituent corporation or the resulting corporation may be organized for profit or not organized for profit and may be a stock corporation or a nonstock corporation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(a) (src:1208)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a stock corporation`                                              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a charitable nonstock corporation`                                THEN TRUE

-- (b) "The board of directors of each stock corporation which desires to merge or consolidate and the governing body of each nonstock
-- corporation which desires to merge or consolidate shall adopt a resolution approving an agreement of merger or consolidation."
-- src:1209 | (b) The board of directors of each stock corporation which desires to merge or consolidate and the governing body of each nonstock corporation which desires to merge or consolidate shall adopt a resolution approving an agreement of merger or consolidation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(b) (src:1209)
DECLARE `s 257(b) Body that adopts the resolution` IS ONE OF
    `the board of directors`
    `the governing body`

-- src:1209 | (b) The board of directors of each stock corporation which desires to merge or consolidate and the governing body of each nonstock corporation which desires to merge or consolidate shall adopt a resolution approving an agreement of merger or consolidation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(b) (src:1209)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
GIVETH A `s 257(b) Body that adopts the resolution`
`s 257(b) the body that must adopt the resolution` k MEANS
    IF `the kind is a stock corporation` k
    THEN `the board of directors`
    ELSE `the governing body`

-- "The agreement shall state: (1) to (6)", with item (5) adding "and the surrender of any certificates evidencing them".
-- src:1209 | The agreement shall state:
-- src:1210 | (1) The terms and conditions of the merger or consolidation;
-- src:1211 | (2) The mode of carrying the same into effect;
-- src:1212 | (3) In the case of a merger, such amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation as are desired to be effected by the merger (which amendments or changes may amend and restate the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation in its entirety), or, if no such amendments or changes are desired, a statement that the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation shall be its certificate of incorporation;
-- src:1213 | (4) In the case of a consolidation, that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as is set forth in an attachment to the agreement;
-- src:1214 | (5) The manner, if any, of converting the shares of stock of a stock corporation and the memberships or membership interests of a nonstock corporation into shares or other securities of a stock corporation or memberships or membership interests of a nonstock corporation surviving or resulting from such merger or consolidation or of cancelling some or all of such shares or memberships or membership interests, and, if any shares of any such stock corporation or memberships or membership interests of any such nonstock corporation are not to remain outstanding, to be converted solely into shares or other securities of the stock corporation or memberships or membership interests of the nonstock corporation surviving or resulting from such merger or consolidation or to be cancelled, the cash, property, rights or securities of any other corporation or entity which the holders of shares of any such stock corporation or memberships or membership interests of any such nonstock corporation are to receive in exchange for, or upon conversion of such shares or memberships or membership interests, and the surrender of any certificates evidencing them …
-- src:1215 | (6) Such other details or provisions as are deemed desirable, including, without limiting the generality of the foregoing, a provision for the payment of cash in lieu of the issuance or recognition of fractional shares, rights or other securities of the surviving or resulting corporation or of any other corporation or entity the shares, rights or other securities of which are to be received in the merger or consolidation, or for some other arrangement with respect thereto, consistent with § 155 of this title …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(b) (src:1209-1215)
GIVEN kind IS A `dg7 Merger or consolidation`
      ag IS A `dg7 Agreement of merger or consolidation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` kind ag MEANS
        `dg7 s 255(b)(1) to (6) the agreement states what items (1) to (6) require` kind ag
    AND (   (NOT ag's `some shares, memberships or membership interests are not to remain outstanding`)
         OR ag's `states the surrender of any certificates evidencing the shares, memberships or membership interests`)

-- (c) "The agreement required by subsection (b) of this section, in the case of each constituent stock corporation, shall be adopted,
-- approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each constituent corporation in the same manner as is provided in s 251 of this title
-- and, in the case of each constituent nonstock corporation, ... in the same manner as is provided in s 255 of this title."
-- src:1217 | (c) The agreement required by subsection (b) of this section, in the case of each constituent stock corporation, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each constituent corporation in the same manner as is provided in § 251 of this title and, in the case of each constituent nonstock corporation, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of said constituent corporations in the same manner as is provided in § 255 of this title …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(c) (src:1217)
DECLARE `s 257(c) Section whose manner of approval governs` IS ONE OF
    `s 251, the section on stock corporations`
    `s 255, the section on nonstock corporations`

-- src:1217 | (c) The agreement required by subsection (b) of this section, in the case of each constituent stock corporation, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each constituent corporation in the same manner as is provided in § 251 of this title and, in the case of each constituent nonstock corporation, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of said constituent corporations in the same manner as is provided in § 255 of this title …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(c) (src:1217)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
GIVETH A `s 257(c) Section whose manner of approval governs`
`s 257(c) the section whose manner of approval governs the constituent corporation` k MEANS
    IF `the kind is a stock corporation` k
    THEN `s 251, the section on stock corporations`
    ELSE `s 255, the section on nonstock corporations`

-- "The agreement shall be filed and shall become effective for all purposes of the laws of this State when and as provided in s 251 of
-- this title with respect to the merger of stock corporations of this State." (The time is s 251's and s 103's: taken as an input.)
-- "Insofar as they may be applicable, the provisions set forth in the last sentence of s 251(c) shall apply ..., and the reference therein
-- to stockholder shall be deemed to include member". (d) s 251(e) applies to a merger under this section; s 251(d) to any constituent stock
-- corporation participating in a merger or consolidation; s 251(f) to any constituent stock corporation participating in a merger.
-- (e) s 251(d) applies to a merger under this section, read for a constituent nonstock corporation as s 255(e) reads it.
-- src:1217 | Insofar as they may be applicable, the provisions set forth in the last sentence of § 251(c) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section, and the reference therein to “stockholder” shall be deemed to include “member” hereunder …
-- src:1218 | (d) Section 251(e) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section; § 251(d) of this title shall apply to any constituent stock corporation participating in a merger or consolidation under this section; and § 251(f) of this title shall apply to any constituent stock corporation participating in a merger under this section …
-- src:1219 | (e) Section 251(d) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section; provided, however, that, for purposes of a constituent nonstock corporation, references to the board of directors, to stockholders, and to shares of a constituent corporation shall be deemed to be references to the governing body of the corporation, to members of the corporation, and to memberships or membership interests, as applicable, respectively …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(c) (src:1217); § 257(d) (src:1218); § 257(e) (src:1219)
GIVEN p IS A `dg7 Provision of s 251 or s 252 brought in by reference`
      ctx IS A `dg7 Context of a provision brought in`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` p ctx MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the last sentence of s 251(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `s 251(d), terminating or amending the agreement before it becomes effective`                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger`                         THEN ctx's `it is a merger and not a consolidation` AND ctx's `the constituent corporation concerned is a stock corporation of this State`
    WHEN `the last sentence of s 252(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`       THEN FALSE
    WHEN `s 252(d), the appointment of the Secretary of State to receive process`                                       THEN FALSE

-- (f) The charitable limit: "the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a stock corporation, if the charitable status of such
-- nonstock corporation would thereby be lost or impaired; but a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation
-- which shall continue as the surviving corporation."
-- src:1220 | (f) Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a stock corporation, if the charitable status of such nonstock corporation would thereby be lost or impaired; but a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(f) (src:1220)
GIVEN kind IS A `dg7 Merger or consolidation`
      `the merging corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation it is merged into` IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` kind `the merging corporation` `the corporation it is merged into` `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` MEANS
        kind EQUALS `a merger into a surviving corporation that is one of the constituent corporations`
    AND `the kind is a charitable nonstock corporation` `the merging corporation`
    AND `the kind is a stock corporation` `the corporation it is merged into`
    AND `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired`

-- src:1220 | but a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 257(f) (src:1220)
GIVEN `the merging corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the surviving corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 257(f) a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `the merging corporation` `the surviving corporation` MEANS
        `the kind is a stock corporation` `the merging corporation`
    AND `the kind is a charitable nonstock corporation` `the surviving corporation`

§ `s 258 Merger or consolidation of domestic and foreign stock and nonstock corporations`

-- (a) "Any 1 or more corporations of this State, whether stock or nonstock corporations and whether or not organized for profit, may merge
-- or consolidate with 1 or more foreign corporations, unless the laws of the jurisdiction or jurisdictions under which such foreign
-- corporation or corporations are organized prohibit such merger or consolidation." "For purposes of this section, the term foreign
-- corporation includes a nonstock corporation organized under the laws of any jurisdiction other than this State."
-- src:1224 | For purposes of this section, the term “foreign corporation” includes a nonstock corporation organized under the laws of any jurisdiction other than this State …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(a) (src:1224)
GIVEN c IS A `dg7 Constituent corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258(a) a foreign corporation` c MEANS
    NOT c's `where the corporation is formed` EQUALS `this State`

-- src:1224 | Any 1 or more corporations of this State, whether stock or nonstock corporations and whether or not organized for profit, may merge or consolidate with 1 or more foreign corporations, unless the laws of the jurisdiction or jurisdictions under which such foreign corporation or corporations are organized prohibit such merger or consolidation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(a) (src:1224)
GIVEN constituents IS A LIST OF `dg7 Constituent corporation`
      `the laws of a jurisdiction under which a foreign corporation is organized prohibit the merger or consolidation` IS A BOOLEAN   -- out of range: the law of another jurisdiction
      `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` constituents `the laws of a jurisdiction under which a foreign corporation is organized prohibit the merger or consolidation` `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section` MEANS
        any (GIVEN c YIELD c's `where the corporation is formed` EQUALS `this State`) constituents
    AND any `s 258(a) a foreign corporation` constituents
    AND (NOT `the laws of a jurisdiction under which a foreign corporation is organized prohibit the merger or consolidation`)
    AND `the agreement complies, and is approved, in accordance with this section`

-- "The surviving or resulting corporation may be either a domestic or foreign stock corporation or a domestic or foreign nonstock
-- corporation, as shall be specified in the agreement of merger or consolidation required by subsection (b) of this section."
-- src:1224 | The surviving or resulting corporation may be either a domestic or foreign stock corporation or a domestic or foreign nonstock corporation, as shall be specified in the agreement of merger or consolidation required by subsection (b) of this section …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(a) (src:1224)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` k MEANS
    `s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` k

-- (b) "The method and procedure to be followed by the constituent corporations so merging or consolidating shall be as prescribed in
-- s 257 of this title in the case of Delaware corporations. The agreement of merger or consolidation shall be as provided in s 257 of this
-- title and also set forth such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in an agreement of merger or consolidation
-- ... by the laws of the jurisdiction or jurisdictions which are stated in the agreement to be the laws under which the foreign corporation
-- or corporations are organized. The agreement, in the case of foreign corporations, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and
