        `s 257(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` kind ag
    AND ag's `states the provisions or facts the laws of each foreign jurisdiction require in an agreement of merger or consolidation`

-- src:1225 | (b) The method and procedure to be followed by the constituent corporations so merging or consolidating shall be as prescribed in § 257 of this title in the case of Delaware corporations …
-- src:1225 | The agreement, in the case of foreign corporations, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which each is organized …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(b) (src:1225)
DECLARE `s 258(b) Approval by one constituent corporation` HAS
    `where the corporation is formed`                                                                                    IS A `Where an entity is formed`
    `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS A BOOLEAN   -- a foreign corporation
    `the corporation was approved by the method and procedure that s 257 prescribes`                                    IS A BOOLEAN   -- a Delaware corporation: s 255 or s 251 by s 257(c)

-- src:1225 | (b) The method and procedure to be followed by the constituent corporations so merging or consolidating shall be as prescribed in § 257 of this title in the case of Delaware corporations …
-- src:1225 | The agreement, in the case of foreign corporations, shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which each is organized …
