      `a certificate of merger or consolidation is filed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the appointment of the Secretary of State is included in the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258(c) the appointment of the Secretary of State is included in the certificate of merger or consolidation as the subsection requires` `the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation` `a certificate of merger or consolidation is filed` `the appointment of the Secretary of State is included in the certificate` MEANS
        (NOT (`the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation` AND `a certificate of merger or consolidation is filed`))
    OR `the appointment of the Secretary of State is included in the certificate`

-- (c) continued: which of ss 251(e), 251(d), 251(f) and 252(d) are brought in. "Section 251(e) shall apply to mergers effected under
-- this section if the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State; s 251(d) shall apply to any constituent corporation
-- participating in a merger or consolidation under this section (provided, however, that for purposes of a constituent nonstock
-- corporation, references to the board of directors, to stockholders, and to shares shall be deemed to be references to the governing
-- body ..., to members ..., and to memberships or membership interests ...); and s 251(f) shall apply to any constituent stock
-- corporation of this State participating in a merger under this section."
-- src:1226 | Section 251(e) of this title shall apply to mergers effected under this section if the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State; § 251(d) of this title shall apply to any constituent corporation participating in a merger or consolidation under this section (provided, however, that for purposes of a constituent nonstock corporation, references to the board of directors, to stockholders, and to shares shall be deemed to be references to the governing body of the corporation, to members of the corporation, and to memberships or membership interests of the corporation, as applicable, respectively); and § 251(f) of this title shall apply to any constituent stock corporation of this State participating in a merger under this section …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(c) (src:1226)
GIVEN p IS A `dg7 Provision of s 251 or s 252 brought in by reference`
      ctx IS A `dg7 Context of a provision brought in`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258 the provision applies to a merger under this section` p ctx MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the last sentence of s 251(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`        THEN FALSE
    WHEN `s 251(d), terminating or amending the agreement before it becomes effective`                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation`                  THEN ctx's `the corporation surviving the merger is a corporation of this State`
    WHEN `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger`                         THEN ctx's `it is a merger and not a consolidation` AND ctx's `the constituent corporation concerned is a stock corporation of this State`
    WHEN `the last sentence of s 252(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`       THEN FALSE
    WHEN `s 252(d), the appointment of the Secretary of State to receive process`                                       THEN ctx's `the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation`

-- (d) The charitable limit: as in s 257(f).
-- src:1227 | (d) Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a stock corporation, if the charitable status of such nonstock corporation would thereby be lost or impaired; but a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 258(d) (src:1227)
GIVEN kind IS A `dg7 Merger or consolidation`
      `the merging corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation it is merged into` IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 258(d) this section does not authorize the merger` kind `the merging corporation` `the corporation it is merged into` `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` MEANS
    `s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` kind `the merging corporation` `the corporation it is merged into` `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired`
